Output demo.mp4
Set FontSize 22
Set Width 1280
Set Height 720
Set Theme "Dracula"

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ '"
Enter
Type "source $HOME/.nvm/nvm.sh && nvm use default --silent 2>/dev/null || true"
Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show

Type "node"
Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type '["1"].map(parseInt)'
Enter
Sleep 2s
